{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>天文台於2026年11月18日晚上7時45分發出特別天氣提示，提醒市民本港天氣將顯著轉涼。受冷鋒隨後的強烈東北季候風及一道雲帶影響，未來一兩日天氣寒冷，尤其是星期五和星期六初時風寒效應較為明顯。\n</p>\n<p>星期五天氣多雲並有幾陣雨，市區氣溫由午夜約18度下降至最低約15度，新界氣溫更低兩至三度，內陸地區及高地將會寒冷。市民特別是進行戶外活動的人士需留意天氣變化，注意保暖，並關顧長者及慢性病患者。</p>\n<p>天文台呼籲市民採取必要的防寒措施，避免長時間暴露於寒冷環境中，並留意最新天氣預報以作出適當安排。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%af%92%e5%86%b7%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">寒冷天氣</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 18 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T12:55:26.249329+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":281,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T12:45:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T13:17:27.391914+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T12:48:33.787596+00:00","content_hash":"744e74ed70f6b15fd8d8c90885709ee019da722fc23b366c1783e3c4a6e7cdf6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}